{"asset_key":"ep2/gameplay_story_12600060","episode":"ep2","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"12600060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1260006001:0":{"text":"まさか、このモンスターたちも……？","source_cn":"这些亡灵怪物，该不会也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64A31891FECD5586","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1260006002:0":{"text":"見てください！姿が変わり始めましたよ！","source_cn":"——看，它们果然也变形了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA27685A1B433536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1260006003:0":{"text":"ロンロンの叫びと共に、モンスターの体がねじれ始め、徐々に人間の女性へと変わっていった。","source_cn":"随着满满的惊呼，怪物的身形开始扭曲，露出了平凡女性的身影。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA0AE7E0C889F932","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1260006004:0":{"text":"女性たちは意識が朦朧としており、しばらくしてからようやく少し元気を取り戻した。","source_cn":"她们看起来昏昏沉沉，过了片刻才终于恢复了些许精神……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED96933F60ECB171","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1260006005:0":{"text":"何があったんだい……？うぅ、気持ち悪い……","source_cn":"发生了什么事……呜呃，有点想吐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E90E6692ECC3710","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1260006006:0":{"text":"目がチカチカするし、体中が痛いわ……","source_cn":"眼睛好花，身上怎么这么酸痛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EEFC4C614A3795F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1260006007:0":{"text":"なんだか、すごく疲れる夢を見た気がします……","source_cn":"刚刚好像是做了个很累人的梦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x441C6E04E07B7805","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1260006008:1":{"text":"あら、ソニアさん？ど、どうしてここに！？","source_cn":"咦，索尼娅女士？您怎么在这里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0A1C753119BCC57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1260006009:0":{"text":"あんたたちは確か……埠頭の近くで帆を作る仕事をしている作業員か。","source_cn":"……你们……我没记错的话，你们是在码头附近专门负责船帆...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE94811CF242EA053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1260006010:0":{"text":"この前、出航を控えている船の帆を緊急で作れないかと、相談しに来たときに会ったな。","source_cn":"前两周好几艘船都等着出海，我记得那时我们见过面，问过你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B7D70C69ECA124B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1260006011:0":{"text":"そうそう。あたいがその時に対応した職長だよ。この二人も、一緒に見積もりや納期の計算を手伝っただろ。","source_cn":"对，我是负责的工长，那时是我和您谈判的，她俩当时也在，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01F947227FAB243E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1260006012:1":{"text":"どうやら、彼女たちもただの被害者のようだな。","source_cn":"看起来这几个人也是无辜的受害者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38785EE93C15EFF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1260006013:0":{"text":"彼女たち「も」？先ほども似たような事があったのか？","source_cn":"受害者……也？你们刚刚碰到了一样的情况？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B01EBE7EEA27C8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1260006014:1":{"text":"はい。ギャングのやつらが、ネズミに姿を変えられたんです。","source_cn":"类似。之前那几个爱挑事的水鬼帮，他们被变成了老鼠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x102A3DC0C726F8DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1260006015:1":{"text":"ネズミ……？","source_cn":"老鼠……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3E055C94069F427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1260006016:1":{"text":"原因は調査中です。","source_cn":"我们正在调查。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3FC449ED093AF8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1260006017:1":{"text":"ネズミにモンスター……ますますややこしくなってきたな。","source_cn":"一会儿变成老鼠，一会儿变成亡灵……事情真是越来越复杂了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4C2D021F6BEEB11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1260006018:1":{"text":"この件については部下たちに調査をさせる。あんたたちが意識を失う前、何か変わったことはなかったか？","source_cn":"各位，刚刚的情况我会安排人去调查清楚，你们在失去意识之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD87FDED87D7A006C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1260006019:0":{"text":"今日は三人とも、休日返上で仕事する予定だったんだ。あたいが最初に工場に着いたけど、何も変なとこはなかったよ。","source_cn":"我们三个约好今天去赶工加班，我先到了工厂，但没发现有什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06337700918AA115","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1260006020:1":{"text":"私、見たかもしれません！へ、変なものを……","source_cn":"我、我好像看到了一些不寻常的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2431037FA3AFD2BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1260006021:0":{"text":"アキーヤを呼びに行く前に、娘を友だちの所へ送り届けたのですが、少し時間がかかって、予定よりも遅くなったんです。","source_cn":"我送女儿去找朋友玩，路上耽搁了一些，所以叫上阿奇雅一起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47B1C5119AB57562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1260006022:1":{"text":"だから、二人で近道を通ろうって……","source_cn":"见到施琳之前，我们提着裙子，抄了一条近路……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1835545DA88ABFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1260006023:0":{"text":"ふふふ、今度はあなたたちに、秋夜の余興になってもらおうかしら。","source_cn":"……呵，这次就选你们成为秋夜节的余兴吧 。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C391BFEC1EA99C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1260006024:0":{"text":"アキーヤ、あそこにいる女の人が見えますか？","source_cn":"阿奇雅，你看到前面那个女人了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7325DF03DB89F61D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1260006025:2":{"text":"どうしたのゾーラ？誰もいないわよ。","source_cn":"怎么了，卓菈。那边什么人都没有呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7109EA4AF729B559","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1260006026:0":{"text":"あれ……消えた？私の見間違いかしら……","source_cn":"咦……消失了？是我看错了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6896D88052F81C82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1260006027:1":{